{"ticker":"TWLO","updated":"2026-11-07T02:00:18Z","profile":{"longName":"Twilio Inc.","shortName":"Twilio Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.twilio.com","fullTimeEmployees":5625,"marketCap":31259369472,"trailingPE":25.379398,"forwardPE":29.460361,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.360469,"pegRatio":0.3,"targetMeanPrice":267.74725,"targetHighPrice":325.0,"targetLowPrice":165.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":29,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.199,"earningsGrowth":3.451,"grossMargins":0.48606,"operatingMargins":0.0953,"profitMargins":0.21824,"totalRevenue":5831461888,"beta":1.494,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":308.4,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":105.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Twilio Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides customer engagement platform solutions in the United States and internationally. The company provides various application programming interfaces and software solutions for communications between customers and end users, including messaging, voice, email, video interactions, digital engagement centers, marketing campaigns, and user authentication and identity solutions. It also offers software products to build direct and personalized relationships with their end users, such as Segment, a platform that provides tools to harness the power of contextual data by unifying real-time information collected throughout each customer's journey into a unique profile. Twilio Inc. was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Twilio Inc. 及其子公司在美國和國際上提供客戶參與平台解決方案。該公司為客戶和最終用戶之間的通訊提供各種應用程式介面和軟體解決方案，包括訊息傳遞、語音、電子郵件、視訊互動、數位參與中心、行銷活動以及用戶身份驗證和身份解決方案。它還提供與最終用戶建立直接和個性化關係的軟體產品，例如 Segment，該平台提供工具，透過將每個客戶旅程中收集的即時資訊統一到一個獨特的配置文件中，利用上下文數據的力量。 Twilio Inc. 成立於 2008 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":109.21,"h":110.185,"l":106.59,"c":109.08,"v":1938500},{"t